## 2. Infrastructure — InvoiceFactory

```csharp
internal static class InvoiceFactory
{
    public static Invoice ForSubscription(
        Guid consumerId, PlanResponse plan, DateTime? expiresAt,
        long discountAmount = 0, string? discountDescription = null,
        long walletCreditUsed = 0) { ... }

    public static Invoice ForRenewal(
        SubscriptionResponse subscription) { ... }

    public static Invoice ForPlanSwitch(
        SubscriptionResponse subscription,
        PlanResponse targetPlan, DateTime now) { ... }
}
```

