## 3. File Structure

```
Domain/Invoices/
    Invoice.cs, InvoiceStatus.cs, InvoiceErrors.cs,
    LineItem.cs, LineItemType.cs

Infrastructure/Invoicing/
    InvoiceFactory.cs, InvoiceRepository.cs
```

---

## 4. Key Decisions

| Decision | Rationale |
|---|---|
| Checkout invoices not saved until webhook | Consumer can go back/abandon — no orphans |
| Renewal invoice saved before charge | No consumer interaction; webhook confirms later |
| Plan Switch = checkout flow | Consumer previews and decides |
| Custom UI Checkout (Stripe Elements) | Seamless, white-labeled experience that fully integrates with Enforcer's custom wallet and promo code logic |
| No `AddLineItem` | All line items computed upfront via Factory |
| [Void()](file:///c:/Users/Mhamed/source/repos/Backend%20Projects/enforcer/backend/src/Modules/Billings/Enforcer.Modules.Billings.Domain/Invoices/Invoice.cs#76-84) instead of delete | Never delete financial records |
